    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[UniFi LTE 6.6.68]]></title>
        <id>0f083cda-91a0-43c0-9fbb-c714790a7b72</id>
        <link href="https://community.ui.com/releases/UniFi-LTE-6-6-68/0f083cda-91a0-43c0-9fbb-c714790a7b72"/>
        <updated>2024-04-17T17:15:17.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Overview
UniFi LTE 6.6.68 adds support for the Canadian region.
Improvements

Added support for the Canadian region.
Improved reporting failover status after the device booted.
Improved factory reset process.

Additional information

Update your devices by changing the Device Firmware Release Channel in the UniFi Network application to Early Access.
If you wish to go back to the Official release after the upgrade, change the release channel back to Official.




If you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us some details on your setup and include the below information:

U-LTE model(s)
Previous LTE release version
UniFi Network application version]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>UI-Glenn</name>
        </author>
    </entry>
